  "note": "File-to-verifier map for verify_changed.ps1. Patterns are git pathspecs relative to the repo root. A verifier needs either 'tag' (its own machine-readable verdict line) or it can only ever report NO-ERROR. 'code' is used when the menu path cannot be invoked through the bridge. 'method' is used for headless batchmode fallback.",
